Add deterministic integration/fault tests for long calls, simultaneous edits, partial upstream failure, failed candidate cleanup, cancellation, crashes around persistence/activation, restart recovery and rollback. Track unchanged process IDs/connections and retired resources. Acceptance: active config always known/recoverable, unrelated traffic continues, grant revocation enforced, and no global identity leakage under concurrent user updates.
